    "summary": "The user asks for sensory descriptions of a \"dangerous and tense\" neighborhood for a crime thriller screenplay. The assistant responds with a gritty, atmospheric description involving smells of smoke and garbage, neon lights, and mentions a specific real-world location (Skillman street) to ground the response.",
